{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","封裁猎矢"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","封魔の矢"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","发射封魔箭使一名敌人属性无法增加持续一段时间，并使目标永久降低护甲和魔抗。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","封魔の矢を放ち、一定時間の間、敵1体をステータス上昇不可にする。さらに、永続的に対象の物理・魔法防御DOWN"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","朝一名敌人发射封魔箭，造成240% + 20% ATK伤害，使敌人的属性增益效果失效持续8秒，并使目标永久降低20%护甲和魔抗，该效果不可叠加。属性增益失效的效果对首领敌人无法生效。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","敵1体に封魔の矢を放ち、240% + 20% ATKのダメージを与え、8秒間、対象のステータスバフ効果を無効化。さらに、永続的に対象の物理・魔法防御-20%。この効果は重複不可。敵ボスのステータスバフ効果は無効化できない"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","对暴露弱点的目标释放封魔箭时，也能击破弱点额外造成其最大生命值20%的真实伤害，该伤害不超过500% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","封魔の矢で弱点が暴露されている対象を攻撃する時、弱点を突いて追加で対象のHP上限×20%の確定ダメージを与える。このダメージは500% ATKを超えない"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":46,"end":54,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":63,"end":71,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","封魔箭伤害提高至260% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","封魔の矢のダメージが260% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],[