は通常攻撃で弱点が暴露されている敵を攻撃する時、弱点を突いて追加で60% + 6% ATKの確定ダメージを与える。通常攻撃で同じ敵の弱点を突ける回数は4秒ごとに1回まで\nインドラの通常攻撃は3本の矢を放ち、1本の矢につき165% + 20% ATKのダメージを与える。3本の矢は弱点が暴露されている異なる対象を優先的に攻撃し、同じ対象にヒットした場合、2本目以降のダメージ-25%"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":54,"end":59,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":121,"end":127,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":92,"end":97,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":170,"end":176,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":51,"end":63,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":117,"end":131,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":89,"end":101,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":166,"end":180,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","普通攻击每枚箭矢的伤害提高至170% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","通常攻撃の矢1本あたりのダメージが170% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","普通攻击每枚箭矢的伤害提高至175% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","通常攻撃の矢1本あたりのダメージが175% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,